Recovery Coordinating Group stood up 29/01 at 1000, chaired by Herefordshire
Council. Response phase formally closed for the Leadon incident at 0900 29/01.

Initial recovery position:
- 19 properties in Ledbury requiring recovery support, 7 in Upton-upon-Severn
- Flood Recovery Framework activation requested via MHCLG
- Community Recovery Grant expected to be the main route for households
- Two businesses on Bye Street report uninsured losses
- Bromyard industrial estate reopened 29/01

Next RCG 05/02 at 1000.

